              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "I cannot directly reserve a parking spot for you, as I don\u2019t have access to your personal information, license plate, or payment methods. \n\nTo help you get this sorted for tomorrow afternoon, **could you let me know which city in Romania you are in?** (e.g., Bucharest, Cluj-Napoca, Bra\u0219ov, Timi\u0219oara, etc.)\n\nDepending on your city, you can easily reserve or pre-pay for a spot using one of the major parking apps:\n\n### 1. If you are in Bucharest:\n* **AmParcat:** One of the most popular and user-friendly apps for Bucharest. It supports quick payments via Apple Pay, Google Pay, and Revolut Pay. You can easily set your parking duration and even enable automatic extensions.\n* **Parking Bucure\u0219ti:** The official app from the Bucharest Municipal Parking Company. It maps out all public parking lots in the city center, helps you navigate to them, and lets you pay via card or SMS.\n* **UPPARK:** Great for choosing specific public zones and managing your parking times.\n\n### 2. If you are in Cluj-Napoca, Bra\u0219ov, Timi\u0219oara, or other cities:\n* **TPARK:** This is the most widely used parking app in Romania, operating in over 80 cities. It allows you to select your city, enter your license plate, choose the city-center zone, and pay instantly via card or SMS.\n* **Cluj Parking:** If you are in Cluj, this app is specifically useful for checking the real-time availability of spaces in barrier-controlled parking lots in the city center before you arrive.\n\n### How to do it:\n1. **Download** the app that best fits your city (TPARK or AmParcat are usually the safest bets for most major cities).\n2. **Enter your license plate number** and link your preferred payment method.\n3. **For private or barrier-guaranteed parking:** If you need a *guaranteed* reserved spot in a private garage (rather than public street parking), look for the nearest **Interparking** (such as Interparking University Square in Bucharest) or use their **P-app** to book ahead of time.\n\nIf you can tell me your exact city and the specific area/landmark you are visiting tomorrow, I can find the closest exact parking garage or street zone for you!",
